<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2PE" style="id">- Bekwel Bible</book>
  <para style="h">2 Pyɛɛd</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mɛkana ɛ Pyɛɛd yii Bhɔɔba</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Pyɛɛd</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Py</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mɛkana ɛ</para>
  <para style="mt1">Pyɛɛd</para>
  <para style="mt2">yii bhɔɔba</para>
  <para style="imt">Ɛniel</para>
  <para style="ip">Mɛkana mak nakwyalaa ɛ́ étɛp ekeletyɛ djas, yɛ ɛ́ dáa mɛkpa mɛ emwana. Mot nakwyal mɛkana mɛ tak ɛpelɛɛ náá, ɛsyee ɛ lɛ eezekunaa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 1:13">1.13</ref></char>). Nyɛ kwyal yɛ ɛ́, étɛp bot ɛ zedum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ neetetaala nɛ mɛlyo mɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mɛkana mɛ ɛpelɛɛ bɛ náá, bɛ baal embɛɛ mɛfulu mɛ di edus tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ lɔɔ nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ, bɛ di sosoob nɛ mɛlyo mɛ bɛ nagwak ɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 1">1</ref></char>). Yɛ ɛpebaadjɛ mɛlyo nɛ bot, dum nɛ bɛmbee bɛlyoel di elyo bot etɛp e etsal nɛ ɛdi ɛ́ tɔ mbee mɛfulu ɔ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 2">2</ref></char>). Bhii tak, yɛ ɛpebaalii dum nɛ ɛwala ɛ Ghɛŋ Yezu aabula ɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 3">3</ref></char>). Kana mɛkɛn mɛ ezɛɛga mendjaala, ekeletyɛ yii kɔkɔ mɛbyel tak naazegwyɛ, Yezu dinaa ààpabula. Bɛdhiiti bot moo ɛ́ zɛm-zɛm, bɛ aakagu étɛp yé, ye di ebɔya. Tin, dáa di náá, bot ɛ zedum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ ɛ́ tɔ bhwood ɛ, <char style="em">Zɛɛb ɛpelyaal náá, nyɛ ɛ́ mot bhwood</char>, étɛp bot djas neeswoola mɛfulu mɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Étɛp ɛkwyee bɛ tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ lɔɔ nɛ Zɛɛb, mot di keletyɛ ɔ, goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛwa lyem tɔ Ekwyala e bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb yii Ɛbhɛŋ ɛ na mwa. Bɛ baagoka ɛ́ nɛ ɛwa lyem tɔ mɛlyo mɛ bɛ nagwak nɛ bɛtyaasɛs ɛ Yezu Klisto ɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 3:2">3.2</ref></char>). É sok mɛkana mɛ bhɔɔba ɛ Pyɛɛd nadi ekwyalaa ɛ́, bɛdhiiti bɛmɛkana ɛ Pɔl naaguaa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 3:15">3.15</ref></char>). Sa mot ààlyo bot etɛp ee di kwyala tɔ mɛkana mak, nyɛ di ààgu mɛsuk mɛ tak tɔ Ɛbhɛŋ ɛ na mwa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 1:20">1.20</ref></char>), nɛghu àànyɔ ɛtiibal ɔɔ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 3:16">3.16</ref></char>). Ye goka ɛ́ náá, bɛdhiiti ekeletyɛ nɛ Sisim na Dɛɛ zyɛ zɛkwyee bin.</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2PE 1" />
  <para style="s1">Mɛswosel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 1:1" />Yɛ ɛ́ mam Simɔŋ Pyɛɛd, mot-mɛsa nɛ mot-lwoma ɛ Yezu Klisto. Mɛ kwyal mɛkana mak ɛ́ nɛ bot ɛ di edum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb dáa bisɔ ɔ. Yezu Klisto, mot di Zɛɛb'enaka nɛ Mɛtsik-bot'enaka ɔ, nyɛy ɛ nadjɛ mena ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛlenek, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ ɛ́ piki mot.<verse eid="2PE 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 1:2" />Beta náá, enɛm nɛ embɛɛ nɛ egwyem di nɛ nen etɛɛ náá, bi nɛ gu Zɛɛb nɛ Yezu Klisto Ghɛŋ'enaka!<verse eid="2PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zɛɛb eesɛ́ɛ mena étɛp mɛsa mɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 1:3" />Nɛ mɛbwala mɛ, Ghɛŋ naadjɛ mena esa djas mena nadi nɛ gwyes tak ɛ, étɛp mena neekɛka ɛnyɔɛpe tɔ ɛgwakel nɛ Zɛɛb. Tin, nɛ ghwyil'ɛ met, nyɛ eetel mena mot nadjóo mena étɛp ɛdi tɔ duma yɛ nɛ tɔ mbɛɛ mɛsa mɛ ɔ. <verse eid="2PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 1:4" />Tɔ duma yenek, nɛ tɔ mɛbwala menek, Zɛɛb naakɛk mena eboo etɛtɛ ekɛk. Deenek, ɛbela bi aabela ekɛk binek ɛ, yɛ waasa náá, embee mɛkwosak mɛ bɔs'ak di eleeg bot ɛ, dus tɔ len. Tin bi aakadi ɛ́ tɔ ɛgwakel nɛ Zɛɛb.<verse eid="2PE 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 1:5" />Étɛp tak, saka mɛghaaz, kɛlka tsik epiki kɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ len nɛ Zɛɛb. Deenek, bhis ɛkɛ tɔ tsik epiki, ye goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛbaadi nɛ tɛtɛ ɛgu ɛ ɛkwosak ɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="2PE 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 1:6" />Kɔ ɛgu ɛ ɛkwosak ɛ Zɛɛb, tin bi ɛ́ baagu ɛdil ɛ mɛnyel men. Bhis ɛdil ɛ mɛnyel men, bi ɛ́ baadi nɛ zii. Kɔ zii, bi ɛ́ baadi tɔ ɛgwakel nɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="2PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 1:7" />Tin, tɔ ɛgwakel nɛ Zɛɛb, dika nɛ tɛtɛ ɛgwakel nɛ bɔn-nyɛɛg bin tɔ zɛɛga mendjaala. Bhis ɛdi nɛ tɛtɛ ɛgwakel pak'en, dika tɔ kwyɛl. <verse eid="2PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 1:8" />Yɛ bɛ náá, bi ɛ́ nɛ embɛɛ mɛfulu menek, da bi ɛ́ di esesa yɛ ɔɔ, ye waadjedjɛ etɛtɛ ebhum tɔ len, deenek ɛ, bi aakatɔ́ sok tɔ ɛgu ɛ Ghɛŋ'enaka Yezu Klisto. <verse eid="2PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 1:9" />Mot ɛ di ààbɛ nɛ embɛɛ mɛfulu menek ɔɔ, nyɛ ɛ́ dáa mot edhim, nyɛ ɛ́ nɛ mis mendiila. Mbi yenɔk mot eedjisa náá, Zɛɛb naazedis edhuud e mesyem mɛ na mwa.<verse eid="2PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 1:10" />Bɔn-nyɛɛg, dum nɛ tɛp tak, saka mɛghaaz mɛ ɛlyaal náá, yɛ ɛ́ Zɛɛb ɛ nadjóo bin nɛ ɛtɔ bin. Tin, bi ɛ di esa deenek ɔɔ, bi aanàkabaabema ɛbɛk. <verse eid="2PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 1:11" />Deenek, Zɛɛb ɛ́ waabɛɛ bin ze ɛni ɛ́ tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ na kɔm-kɔm ɛ Mɛtsik-bot'enaka Yezu Klisto, Ghɛŋ'enaka.<verse eid="2PE 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 1:12" />Étɛp tak ɛ, mɛ aagheetetaala bin etɛp binek. Mɛ nɛ gu náá, bi nɛ gu yɛ ɛnyɔɛpe. Ɛkwosak ɛ lam ɛ́ náá, bi pyet ɛlyelɛpe tɔ esosoob nɛ etsɛɛtsɛ ee bi nagwak ɛ. <verse eid="2PE 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 1:13" />Mɛ bee ɛ́ náá, dáa mɛ dinaa nɛ tsik ɛ, mɛ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛgheetetaala bin etɛp binek étɛp bi needi ndjem. <verse eid="2PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 1:14" />Tin, mɛ nɛ gu náá, dwoo ɛsyee ɛ lam moo ekunaa, dáa Ghɛŋ'enaka Yezu Klisto naazetel mɛ ɛ. <verse eid="2PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 1:15" />Deenek, mɛ waasa náá, ye nakoozodi bhis ɛsyee ɛ lam, bi gheetetaala nɛ etɛp bak.<verse eid="2PE 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bot ɛ nabee duma ɛ Klisto ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 1:16" />É ghɛŋ bis nalɛɛ bin etɛp dum nɛ ɛzyɛ ɛ́ Ghɛŋ'es Yezu Klisto tɔ boo mɛbwala mɛ ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ kɔ esa e esua-esua. Tin, yɛ ɛ́ etɛɛ náá, bis ɛ́ bɛtyaasɛs nabee mɛkas mɛ ɔ. <verse eid="2PE 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 1:17" />Deenek, nyɛ naabela duu nɛ duma Zɛɛb Sɛɛg. É ɛwala ɛlenek, gwood ɛ Zɛɛb nagék tɔ boo mɛkas ɛ́ náá: «Mot'ak ɛ́ Mɔn'am mɛ di ekwyɛl ɔ, yɛ ɛ́ nyɛy ɛ mɛ natɔ nɛ mɛmyaala djas<note caller="*" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mat 3.17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:5">17.5</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="2PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 1:18" />Bisɔ bɛmet naagwak gwood dáa ye nagék pɛ tɔ gwoo é sok bis nadi sama wat nɛ nɛ pɛ kɔ ɛtsok ɛ na dɛɛ ɛ.<verse eid="2PE 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 1:19" />Tin, bis nɛ wa lyem tɔ mɛkpa mɛ bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb. Dɔɔ nɛ biyɔ pe, bi baagoka ɛ́ nɛ ɛkobaka nɛ yɛ: yɛ ɛ́ tyee wat nɛ lama di egoo tɔ ghooghom kɛkum ɛwala ɛ mɛlem di elem, da mɛkas mɛ dwoo ɛ́ djɛ gwyɛ tɔ elyem bin ɛ. <verse eid="2PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 1:20" />Tin, bi goka ɛ́ nɛ gu náá, mot tok nɛ ghwyil ɛgoola Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb dáa lyem'ɛ kwyɛl ɛ. <verse eid="2PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 1:21" />Ye tok nɛ sa bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb nalɛɛ náá, yɛ aasael, di edus nɛ ɛkwosak bɔɔ bɛmet ɛ. Yɛ ɛ́ Sisim na Dɛɛ ɛ nadi edjɛ bɛ ghwyil ɛlii etɛp binek.<verse eid="2PE 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2PE 2" />
  <para style="s">Bɛmbee bɛlyoel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 2:1" />É ghɛŋ na mwa, ye nadi ɛ́ nɛ bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb yii mɛkɔŋ pɛ tɔ ɛdhuu ɛ bot ɛ Yisalaɛl. Yɛ aabaadi ɛ́ nɛ bɛmbee bɛlyoel tɔ len. Bɛ waalyo bin mɛlyo mɛ esua-esua, étɛp bi neewo ze. Tin, bɛ waaswonal tɛtɛ lyoel, mot natsik bɛ ɔ. Bɛ waadul mbee baka kɔ lɔɔ zaka. <verse eid="2PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 2:2" />Deenek, bɛtɛ nɛ bot ɛ́ waadu embee mɛfulu mɛ mɛzɔ mɔɔ. Tin, kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɔɔ, mbula bot ɛ́ waadhusal ze etsɛɛtsɛ. <verse eid="2PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 2:3" />Dum nɛ dɔɔb mɛvu, bɛ waasa náá, bɛ wyisal bin epata nɛ embee mɛlyo mɛ esua-esua. Deenek, ye nabɛ ɛ́, Zɛɛb naaloozewa bɛ é feŋ, tin, ye kalik ɛ́ batsa bɛ bee mezuk mɔɔ.<verse eid="2PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 2:4" />Tin, Zɛɛb nabɛ ɛ́ ààpel efofop nasyem ɔ, nyɛ naamwas bɛ tɔ guk na dim-dim di ààbɛ nɛ ɛsik ɛ, pɛ kyee bɛ di kɔɔla nɛ ekel e eghwooz tɔ ghooghom, ebwood epɛ́ɛ bɔɔ ɛ. <verse eid="2PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 2:5" />Tyee wat, Zɛɛb nabɛ ɛ́ ààpel bot ɛ na mwa, é sok nyɛ nadesal bɔs nɛ boo bhyoŋ ɛ. É ghɛŋ tak, bɔs nabɛ ɛ́ tɔɔɔ nɛ bot ɛ di esa etɛp ee Zɛɛb di ààkwyɛl ɔ. Tin, nyɛ nazotsik ɛ́ Noe, mot nadi egoola mɛkpa mɛ epiki ɔ, zɛnɔɔ bɛdhiiti bot bɛtɛn nɛ bɛbá. <verse eid="2PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 2:6" />Zɛɛb naakwyesal eghaada Sodɔm nɛ Ghomɔɔd ndjɛ sɔs. Deenek, nyɛ nasaab yɛ ɛ́ nɛ du. Tin, yɛ ɛ́ dhatyee nyɛ aasa nɛ bot ɛ mesyem ɛ. <verse eid="2PE 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 2:7" />Tin, Zɛɛb naapɛk Lɔt mot epiki, mot nadi ekpaa lyem kɔ ɛsu ɛ embee mɛfulu mɛ mɛzɔ mɛ bot ɛ eghaada binek di esa ɛ. <verse eid="2PE 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 2:8" />Yɛ kabɛ Lɔt mot epiki yenɔk ɔɔ, nyɛ nadidi ɛ́ pak bot ɛ nadi nɛ mbee tsik ɔ, tin, nyɛ nadi ebee nɛ ɛgwak ɛ bɛ mɛlu nɛ mɛlu. É di'enek, lyem epiki bɛ nadi ezuk é ɛbee embee mɛfulu menek. <verse eid="2PE 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 2:9" />Deenek, ye kwyɛl ɛlyaal ɛ́ náá, Ghɛŋ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛpɛk bot ɛ di sosoob nɛ nɛ tɔ mezuk ɔ. Tin, nyɛ aanɛɛg bot ɛ mbee tsik étɛp ɛwa bɛ é feŋ dwoo epɛ́ɛ. <verse eid="2PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 2:10" />Tin, nyɛ waawa bot djas di nɛ gwyes ɛdi tɔ edhuud ɔ é feŋ, bot ɛ di ekɛ tɔ gwyes epuud, da bɛ ɛ́ byen eghɛŋ e Zɛɛb ɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 2:10">Bɛmbee bɛlyoel binɔk, bɛ ɛ́ nɛ ɛbet, bɛ nɛ ghɛɛa mɛnyel, bɛ tok nɛ bwoo ɛnyek ɛ esisim duma di tɔ gwoo ɛ. <verse eid="2PE 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 2:11" />Bela náá, efofop tok nɛ ghwyil ɛkolee-leeak esisim e tak é mis ɛ Ghɛŋ. Dhi bot di egu náá, bɛ eedhaa bɛlyoel binɔk nɛ ghwyil nɛ mɛbwala. <verse eid="2PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 2:12" />Tin, bot binɔk ɛ́ dáa bɛtit, ààbɛ nɛ etsoŋ. Bɛ nabyel ɛ́ étɛp bɛ neebel é elaab, bhii tak, da bɛ ɛ́ góaa. Mɛsa mɔɔ ɛ́, ɛlee sa bɛ di ààgu ɛ, bɛ aagwyɛ ɛ́ dáa bɛtit. <verse eid="2PE 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 2:13" />Mbee mɛsa mɛ bɛ nasa nɛ bɛsɔ bɔɔ ɛ, yɛ aadi ɛ́ bulelaa bɛ. Bɛ kwyɛl ɛ́ ɛmyaala tɔ embee etɛp é mwos dwoo. É ghɛŋ bi di ebɔl mɛbyoŋ bi nɛ bɛnɔɔ ɛ, yɔbɔ mɛsa kɔ mɛbyoŋ ɛ́, ɛkɔɔ bin étɛp bɛ neegheesesa etɛp e sen elyem bɔɔ di ekwyɛl ɛ. <verse eid="2PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 2:14" />Mis mɔɔ ɛ́ mis mɛ mɛzɔ, bɛ ààdjil tɔ syem. Mɛsa mɔɔ ɛ́, ɛkɔp bot ɛ di etyak mis ɔ. Bɛ ɛ́ bɛ na ghaa dɔɔb mɛvu. Tin, mbee baka Zɛɛb ɛ́ kɔ lɔɔ. <verse eid="2PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 2:15" />Bhii bɛ nadus kɔ tɛtɛ ze ɛ, bɛ eezewo ze. Bɛ kadu ɛ́ ze ɛ Bhalaam mɔn ɛ Bhozɔɔd, mot nadyeebakwyɛl epata ee bɛ nadi edjɛ nyɛ, étɛp nyɛ neesa sa ɛbiyo ɔ. <verse eid="2PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 2:16" />Tin, Zɛɛb nabiyo nɛ nɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛdjak ɛ lɛ. Wɔ gwaa, mɔɔ yaaga di edjóoaa an ɛ moo tin elii dáa mot, nyɛ eelu ewo ee Bhalaam nadi esa ɛ<note caller="*" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:4-35">Ɛla 22.4-35</ref></char></note>.<verse eid="2PE 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 2:17" />Bɛmbee bɛlyoel binɔk ɛ́ dáa esɔɔgɔ di ààbɛ nɛ mɛdii ɛ, dáa eguud di ewaazel nɛ pup tɔ gwoo ɛ. Zɛɛb naazekoobal bɛ di pɛ kyee bɛ aabookɛdi tɔ mbee mɛghomela ɛ. <verse eid="2PE 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 2:18" />Tin, mɛlyo mɔɔ ɛ́ ɛgwyaŋɛpe, ye bu ɛ́ boo mɛnyeka. Bɛ ɛpebatakɔp bot tɔ tsik epuud, nɛ tɔ mɛzɔ mɔɔ, bot ɛ di náá, bɛ aaloo nɛ dus tɔ bot ɛ mbee tsik ɔ. <verse eid="2PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 2:19" />É di'enek, bɛ kɛk bɛ ɛ́ mɛpɛka, ghuna bɔɔ bɛmet ɛ́ tɔ ekwom e bhel embee mɛfulu mɔɔ. Etɛɛ náá, mot nɛ mot ɛ́ kwom sa di edhaa nyɛ nɛ ghwyil ɛ. <verse eid="2PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 2:20" />Deenek, bot ɛ zegu Ghɛŋ Yezu Klisto Mɛtsik-bot yenaka ɔ, bɛ eezebet embee mɛfulu mɛ bɔs. Tin, bɛ baabet náá, bɛ baaduma tɔ etɛp binek ɔɔ, é di'enek, ekwom bɔɔ aadhaa yii sok. <verse eid="2PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 2:21" />Ye nabɛ ɛ́ ààgoka náá, bɛ gu ze epiki. Ààbɛ náá, bɛ gu, da bhii tak, bɛ ɛ́ zɛliig koŋ nɛ mɛtiŋ mɛ na dɛɛ nagoolaaa bɛ ɛ. <verse eid="2PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2PE 2:22" />Tin, sa di esa bɛ mos ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ sa nadi kwyala tɔ ekana ɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2PE 2:22">«Bhyɛ ɛpebaadɛ sa nyɛ gó ɛ<note caller="*" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 26:11">Eka 26.11</ref></char></note>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2PE 2:22">ghwyee zegwyiiaa ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2PE 2:22">nyɛ eebaabula tɔ bhɔtɔ.»<verse eid="2PE 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2PE 3" />
  <para style="s">Ghɛŋ moo kɔ nɛ ɛbula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 3:1" />Bɛwɛn bam, yak ɛ́ mɛkana mam yii bhɔɔba mɛ di ekwyal bin ɛ. Tɔ bɛmɛkana menek djas ebá, mɛ nadi ekwyɛl ɛsa náá, esisim bin di nɛ esiiza na dɛɛ dum etɛp djas mɛ di elyo bin ɛ. <verse eid="2PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 3:2" />É di'enek, mɛ kwyɛl ɛ́ náá, bi tetaala mɛkpa mɛ bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb na dɛɛ nagoola ɛ. Da, bi ɛ́ baataala mɛtiŋ mɛ Ghɛŋ Mɛtsik-bot nadjɛ bot ɛ lwoma náá, bɛ lyo bin ɛ.<verse eid="2PE 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 3:3" />Bi goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛgu sok náá, é mɛlu mɛ mɛsik mɛ bɔs, yɛ aadi ɛ́ nɛ bot ɛ di esuu mɛso, bot ɛ ebeme di esa mɛkwosak mɛ elyem bɔɔ ɛ. <verse eid="2PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 3:4" />Bɛ waadi eke náá: «Nyɛ naakɛk ɛbula, etsal é? Haaa nenak nyɛ ɛ́ paa? Etɛɛ náá, bɛbhaab bis eezegwyɛ, etɛp djas ààpaswoola kana mɛkɛn mɛ bhwak.» <verse eid="2PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 3:5" />Tin, é sok bɛ di eke deenek ɛ́, bɛ ɛpedjisa sa wat náá: é ghɛŋ sok, Zɛɛb nakus gwoo nɛ bɔs ɛ́ nɛ mɛkpa mɛ. Deenek, nyɛ naazɛbɛk bɔs nɛ mɛdii, bɔs nakusaa ɛ́ nɛ mɛdii. <verse eid="2PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 3:6" />Yɛ ɛ́ tyee wat nɛ mɛdii, mɛdii mɛ boo bhyoŋ ɛ nadesal bɔs, yii nagó bot ɛ na mwa. <verse eid="2PE 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 3:7" />Yɛ kabɛ gwoo nɛ bɔs yii bot dika mos'aak ɔɔ, Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb naazelɛɛ nɛ nes náá, yɛ aagóaa ɛ́ nɛ du. É di'enek, du tak ɛ́ nɛɛga étɛp dwoo epɛ́ɛ, bot ɛ mesyem ɛ́ waagóaa tɔ tak.<verse eid="2PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 3:8" />Bɛwɛn bam, yɛ ɛ́ nɛ sa wat di náá, sa bi ààdjisa ɛ. Guka náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2PE 3:8">«Pɛ daa Ghɛŋ ɛlu wat ɛ́ dhatyee membu mil,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2PE 3:8">membu mil ɛ́ dhatyee ɛlu wat pɛ daa lɛ<note caller="*" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 90:4">Mɛd 90.4</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="2PE 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 3:9" />Deenek, Ghɛŋ aanàbaabɔya nɛ ɛsa sa nyɛ nakɛk ɛ, dáa bɛdhiiti bot di ebee náá, ye ɛpebɔya ɛ. Deenek, nyɛ ɛpemaad lyem kɔ ɛsu ɛ len, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ ààpakwyɛl náá, bɛdhiiti bot gwyɛ tɔ mesyem. Tin, nyɛ kwyɛl ɛ́ náá, bot djas bela ze ɛswoola mɛfulu mɔɔ, da bɛ ɛ́ bula pɛ daa Zɛɛb. <verse eid="2PE 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 3:10" />Deenek, dwoo ɛlu ɛ Ghɛŋ aazyɛ ɛ, yɛ aadi ɛ́ zaka, dáa mot djii di ezyɛ zɛdjii ɛ. Dwoo lɛɛg, bhwak djas ɛ́ waadiib nɛ esa bɛ djas, bot ɛ́ waagwak boo ndum é ghɛŋ esonok binek djas aadyak ɛ. Tin, bɔs nɛ esa bɛ djas ɛ́ waadhaa é ɛpɛ́ɛ.<verse eid="2PE 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 3:11" />Dáa ye di náá, esonok djas ɛ́ waadiib ɛ, guka ɛnyɔɛpe sa bot di egoka nɛ ɛsa ɛ. Ye nyɔ ɛ́ náá, mɛfulu mena di embɛɛ mɛfulu mɛ edɛɛ. Mɛfulu tak, goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛlyaal ɛ́, ɛgwakel ɛ lena nɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="2PE 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 3:12" />Tɔ ɛgwaal ɛ ɛlu ɛ Zɛɛb, saka mɛghaaz, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ neeleebula. Dwoo lɛɛg, gwoo ɛ́ waadyak tɔ du, esa djas di tɔ gwoo ɛ, ye waadjin tɔ ngel du. <verse eid="2PE 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 3:13" />Tin, sa mena di egwaalka ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ ekɛk e gwoo na bes, nɛ bɔs na bes yii Zɛɛb nakɛk mena pɛ kyee bot ɛ di ekɛ tɔ epiki aakɛdi ɔ.<verse eid="2PE 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 3:14" />Bɛwɛn bam, tɔ ɛgwaal ɛ ɛlu ɛlenek, saka mɛghaaz mɛ ɛdi dɛɛ, etɛɛ náá, bi needi ààbɛ nɛ mbee ɛtɔn é mis ɛ Zɛɛb, étɛp ɛdi tɔ ɛgwakel nɛ nɛ. <verse eid="2PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 3:15" />Guka náá, lyem bhwood Ghɛŋ'enaka ɛpedjɛ mena ze tsik. Tin, Pɔl mɔn-nyɛɛg'ena mena di ekwyɛl ɔ nakwyal bin mɛkana ɛ́, nɛ etsoŋ djas Zɛɛb nadjɛ nyɛy ɛ. <verse eid="2PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 3:16" />Nyɛ nazolɛɛ ɛ́ sa wat tɔ bɛmɛkana mɛ djas nyɛ di elii tɛp'ak ɛ. Tin, yɛ ɛ́ nɛ mɛlaŋel di náá, bot àànyɔ ɛtiibal ɛ. Bot ɛ di ààgu sonok, ààtɔ́ mɛdjek ɔ, bɛ nɛ dyeebakwyɛl ɛswoola mɛsuk mɛ tak. Deenek, bɛ ɛ́ nɛ mɛfulu mɛ ɛsa yɛ nɛ edhiiti Ekwyala na dɛɛ. Tin, bɛ saab ɛ́ mɛnyel mɔɔ.<verse eid="2PE 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mɛlyo mɛ mɛsik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 3:17" />Bɛwɛn bam, yɛ kabɛ biyɔ ɔɔ, nenak, bi eezedulaa mɛlɔ. Dika ndjem, sa bi ààwo ze kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛdjak ɛ bot ɛ di ààkaab etɛp e Zɛɛb ɔ. Tin, sa bi ààpul ɛpyet ɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ len nɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="2PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 3:18" />Bi goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛtɔ́ sok tɔ enɛm nɛ embɛɛ, nɛ ɛgu ɛ Ghɛŋ'enaka Yezu Klisto, Mɛtsik-bot'enaka.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 3:18">Beta náá, duu di nɛ nɛ, kana nenak kɛtɔ́ kɔm-kɔm sii nɛ kɔm! <char style="sc">Amɛn</char>.<verse eid="2PE 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 3" />
</usx>